### Function `perl:Shop.Cart.subtotal`  @ lib/Shop/Cart.pm:116
```perl
sub subtotal {
    my ($self) = @_;

    my $subtotal = 0;
    for my $item ( @{ $self->{items} } ) {
        $subtotal += $item->{price} * $item->{quantity};
    }

    return $subtotal;
}
```

